While we are discussing weapons and gods I would like to make a suggestion.

Would it be possible to allow a character's alignment (lawful, neutral, and
chaotic) to be specified via the NETHACKOPTIONS environment variable?

Your alignment not only affects what weapons you can/will be given by your
god it also determines pluses and minuses for certain behavior.

Just because I am a Wizard does not mean that I must have a neutral alignment.
I'm sure chaotic and lawful Wizards would also make sense.  I suppose that
a forced alignment makes sense for some characters, such as Knights; but for
most of the character classes I think the player should be able to choose
his/her own alignment.  Priests/Priestesses (spelling?) are another example;
they should be able to have at least a lawful or chaotic alignment (I guess
a neutral alignment might not make sense for a religous person, unless they
are a fanatical athiest! (-; ).  What do other players think of this idea?

